#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_payslip.py:0
msgid "No debit account for EXPENSES rules"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີບັນຊີໜີ້ສຳລັບກົດເກນຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍ"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_payroll_structure.py:0
msgid ""
"No debit account found in the '%(rule_name)s' payslip salary rule. Please "
"add a payable debit account to be able to create an accounting entry for the"
" expenses linked to this payslip."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ພົບສາຍບັນຊີໜີ້ໃນກົດເກນເງິນເດືອນ '%(rule_name)s'. ກະລຸນາເພີ່ມບັນຊີເຈົ້າໜີ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສ້າງລາຍການ"
"ບັນຊີສຳລັບຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍ ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບໃບລາຍຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນນີ້."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_payslip.py:0
msgid "No rule to handle expenses"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີກົດເກນເພື່ອຈັດການຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍ"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid ""
"Only approved and posted expenses that were paid by an employee can be "
"reimbursed in a payslip."
msgstr ""
"ສະເພາະຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸມັດ ແລະ ລົງບັນຊີແລ້ວ ທີ່ຈ່າຍໂດຍພະນັກງານເທົ່ານັ້ນ ຈຶ່ງສາມາດຊຳລະຄືນໃນໃບລາຍ"
"ຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນໄດ້."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#: model:ir.model,name:hr_payroll_expense.model_account_payment_register
