msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງເງິນເດືອນ"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_payroll_structure.py:0
msgid ""
"The '%(account_name)s' account for the salary rule '%(rule_name)s' must be "
"of type 'Payable'."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີ '%(account_name)s' ສຳລັບກົດເກນເງິນເດືອນ '%(rule_name)s' ຕ້ອງເປັນປະເພດ 'ບັນຊີເຈົ້າ"
"ໜີ້'."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid "There are no valid expenses selected."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຖືກເລືອກ."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot remove an expense from a payslip that has already been validated.\n"
"Expenses can only be removed from draft or canceled payslips."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຖອນຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍອອກຈາກໃບລາຍຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນທີ່ໄດ້ກວດສອບແລ້ວ.\n"
"ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍສາມາດຖອນອອກໄດ້ຈາກໃບລາຍຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນທີ່ເປັນສະບັບຮ່າງ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເລີກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid "You do not have permission to add this expense to a payslip."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດໃນການເພີ່ມຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນໃບລາຍຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນ."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_payslip.py:0
msgid ""
"You don't have the access rights to link an expense to a payslip. You need "
"to be a payroll officer to do that."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນການເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍເຂົ້າກັບໃບລາຍຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນເຈົ້າໜ້າທີ່ຝ່າຍ"
"ເງິນເດືອນເພື່ອດຳເນີນການນີ້."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "You don't have the access rights to post an invoice."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນການລົງບັນຊີໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້."
